<SceneText>
  <Speakers>
    <Section>Speaker</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45580</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mel&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45728,45912,46092,46180,46428,46652</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45832,46012,46344,46580</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>アルベルト</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Albert</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45584</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_004_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わたし……わたしのせいで……虹輪が……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I... Because of me..
The Prism Ring...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45732</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_004_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>まだ原因もわかんねーんだろ、気にすんなって。
だいじょーぶだって……タンス野郎もなんか言えよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We dunno what caused it, do we? So don't worry
about it, it's fiiine... Hey, you tell her, too, closet freak!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45836</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_004_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>気にすることないだーよ。&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;は悪くないだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's nothin' to worry about.
&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;'s not done anythin' wrong.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45916</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_004_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうそう、悪くない悪くない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, exactly.
Not your fault.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46016</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_004_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>今回の件で一番悪いのは、このクソぼうずだーよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The only one at fault
here's this damn brat.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46096</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_004_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうそう、オレが全部悪い……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, exactly.
It's all my fault...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46184</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_004_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>んだよ！　なんでオレが悪いんだよ！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, what the hell!?
How's it my fault!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46348</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_004_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おめぇがかっこつけて、魔物を退治しようとしたからだ。
放っておけば、&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;もこんな目に合わなかっただよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>'Cause you were tryin' to be all cool, beatin' up them
monsters. If not for that, &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;'d still be fine.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46432</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_004_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あんな状況放っておけねーだろ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, I couldn't just ignore a
situation like that, could I!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46584</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_004_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>けっ！　ヒーロー気取りがぁ！　おめぇのかっこつけで、
&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;まで巻きこまれてかわいそーだど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ya damn hero-wannabe! Ya tried too hard to be cool,
and now ya've gone and made &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt; all sad!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46656</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_004_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オ、オレかぁ……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>S-So, it's my fault...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Notice</Section>
  </Strings>
</SceneText>
